          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 89140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando vogliamo assicurarci che una raccolta di valori non contenga duplicati, la memorizziamo in un <strong>set</strong>, come questi codici postali.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'SW1A', 'SY3', 'B44'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un set memorizza valori senza duplicati. Racchiudili tra parentesi graffe <code>{}</code>. Memorizza i codici postali in un set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;SW1A&quot;, &quot;SY3&quot;, &quot;B44&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 89375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli insiemi come <code>postcodes</code> sono raccolte di valori come le liste, ma non consentono valori duplicati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>postcodes</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un set è simile a una lista, ma elimina i duplicati. Assegna un nome alla variabile che memorizza questo set, così la stampa funziona.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"postcode\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>postcodes</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Curly braces",
            "id": 89141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare un set, iniziamo con le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> per racchiudere i valori del set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un set si crea racchiudendo i suoi valori tra parentesi graffe. Racchiudi i codici postali affinché formino un set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
